  "description": "Jeong-Won Yoo endures endless complaints and insults every day at a customer support call center. But one day, when the stress becomes too much, a caller’s calm, soothing voice gives him a rare moment of comfort. Certain he’ll never hear it again, Jeong-Won is stunned to recognize the same voice at a local restaurant—belonging to the kind server, Gyu-Hyeok Lee. Too shy to approach him first, Jeong-Won admires him from afar. However, he isn’t the only one who can’t stop thinking about that call.\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
